{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-06-07 15:20:00', 'title': 'JCP&L COMPLETES INSPECTIONS AND MAINTENANCE TO ENHANCE SERVICE RELIABILITY FOR CUSTOMERS THROUGH THE SUMMER', 'text': 'HOLMDEL, N.J., JUNE 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JERSEY CENTRAL POWER AND LIGHT (JCP&L), A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), HAS COMPLETED INSPECTIONS AND CONDUCTED EQUIPMENT MAINTENANCE PROJECTS ACROSS ITS 3,200-SQUARE-MILE SERVICE AREA TO ENHANCE CUSTOMER SERVICE RELIABILITY AS PART OF ITS ANNUAL SUMMER PREPAREDNESS PLAN.'}